          {
            "chunk_id": "p1_n22",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "(57) Abstract :\nThe present invention relates to a chatbot that provides a digital, intuitive platform for farmers across the globe to access various farming solutions and details, such as Minimum Support Price (MSP) updates, contractor details, and crop-specific farming tips to boost yield and financial gains. The chatbot comprises a centralized platform where farmers can access all necessary information and solutions, including crop MSPs, farming tips, weather updates, and government schemes, without the need to navigate multiple platforms; Multilanguage support to make accessibility easy for farmers from diverse regions; and resource redirection to redirect farmers on government websites, FAQs, tutorials etc. which are verified. The chatbot provides a support-focused interface that delivers well-organized responses to a diverse range of queries. Additionally, it provides farmers with real-time updates on government schemes, financial assistance programs, and resources. By enabling this chatbot for farmers, this tool aims to provide A-Z solutions to farmers' problems. With this digital approach to catering to farmers, overall farming efficiency will be increased, making it an essential tool for the growth of the farming community.",
            "section": "",
            "reading_order": 22,
            "bbox": {
              "x1": 0.058,
              "y1": 0.422,
              "x2": 0.939,
              "y2": 0.489
            }
          },
